      "statement": "RTLPciDevice::sampleIrq() only calls intrPost()/intrClear() on a 0->1 or 1->0 edge of rtlGetIrq(), not every cycle it is held, and RISC-V PLIC routing for the interrupt is derived from the device's PCI slot via GenericRiscvPciHost::mapPciInterrupt(), not its InterruptLine param.",
