    {
      "id": "claim_daa4981ff79f4c37abd6addcd8344c22",
      "statement": "RTLPciDevice::init() binds the inherited pioPort to a RangeForwardPort stub whose recvRangeChange() forwards to rtlPio.sendRangeChange(), because getPort(\"pio\") hands out rtlPio and leaves pioPort unbound while gem5's PciDevice/PciEndpoint writeConfig() call pioPort.sendRangeChange() directly on BAR and COMMAND writes; with the stub bound, RTLPciDevice::init() calls up to PciEndpoint::init(), unlike RTLPioDevice/RTLDmaDevice.",
      "evidence": [
