    {
      "id": "claim_04779a6780784b0398eace7ea5d323a0",
      "statement": "RTLPciDevice::tick() calls slaveEngine.tick() then masterEngine.tick(false) so the shared Verilated model's clock pin is toggled exactly once per gem5 cycle, and idle-gating additionally requires !irqAsserted (beyond RTLDmaDevice's conditions) so a pending interrupt deassertion edge stays observable.",
      "evidence": [
