      "statement": "RTLPciDevice.py defines rtl_pio_latency (default 0ns, extra device-side overhead distinct from PciDevice's own pio_latency), reset_cycles (default 10), and idle_gate_cycles (default 16, 0 disables gating), and has no pio_addr/pio_size param since the BAR defines the address range.",
